    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About this game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >'Arithmetic' is a puzzle game combining box-pushing and math operations. Challenge your logic and arithmetic skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The core gameplay is moving  and push the numbers/operators around, and merge numbers with math operations to get the target number.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500640/extras/cec3b7810c8b994289a3996b094cc5fb.avif?t=1740009542\" data-has-big width=800 height=446 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >75 levels total</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500640/extras/5cf63dbbb1ed7e22d690d6af9eacb314.avif?t=1740009542\" data-has-big width=800 height=442 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15+ operators/tricks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500640/extras/91e732b6001fa3601b5b1a1715c0adff.avif?t=1740009542\" width=468 height=298 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >custom level editor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500640/extras/2365a1411f7973f52558f7b5fdc4410f.avif?t=1740009542\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your custom level and share with players.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Editor</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse Right Click on board to open radial menu</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse Left Click on radial menu item to settle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press Mouse Left Button and drag to move item around</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click on item to selected it</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For number and belt, properties will show on the bottom panel for you to change the number/direction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To remove item, select it and press 'Delete' key</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About this game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >'Arithmetic' is a puzzle game combining box-pushing and math operations. Challenge your logic and arithmetic skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The core gameplay is moving  and push the numbers/operators around, and merge numbers with math operations to get the target number.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500640/extras/cec3b7810c8b994289a3996b094cc5fb.avif?t=1740009542\" data-has-big width=800 height=446 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >75 levels total</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500640/extras/5cf63dbbb1ed7e22d690d6af9eacb314.avif?t=1740009542\" data-has-big width=800 height=442 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15+ operators/tricks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500640/extras/91e732b6001fa3601b5b1a1715c0adff.avif?t=1740009542\" width=468 height=298 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >custom level editor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500640/extras/2365a1411f7973f52558f7b5fdc4410f.avif?t=1740009542\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your custom level and share with players.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Editor</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse Right Click on board to open radial menu</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse Left Click on radial menu item to settle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press Mouse Left Button and drag to move item around</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click on item to selected it</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For number and belt, properties will show on the bottom panel for you to change the number/direction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To remove item, select it and press 'Delete' key</p></li></ul>",
